Subject: [PATCH] T5.3: coupling parity

test/coupling_parity.jl: the GPU engine (single, mixed, double) against the mf6 engine
on 3 monthly and 31 daily periods, tight closures (ModflowGPU PLAN.md section 4 coupling
criteria) and production closures (logged); closure table with
MODFLOWCOUPLING_CLOSURE_TABLE=1. AMDGPU as a test dependency, MODFLOWCOUPLING_BACKEND
selects the GPU engine's backend; test groups (Pkg.test(test_args = ["parity"]) or
MODFLOWCOUPLING_TESTS).

